<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Asiatic year net falls 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Asiatic year net falls 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  53.16   vs	  59.92</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  7.2    vs	   8.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		   195.81   vs	 223.57</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    69.05   vs	  80.68</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.01   vs  add    0.43</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    less  0.48   vs  add    16.14</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)   2.50   vs	    2.375</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Asiatic Development Bhd is a plantations and property concern and is a unit of Genting Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
